# ERPNext (Frappe Cloud). Server-side only.
# Copy to .env.local. Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_ or it is inlined into the
# client bundle.
#
# ERP_URL is the only variable required. The site calls ERPNext unauthenticated
# as the Frappe `Guest` user, which can reach nothing except the two whitelisted
# methods in satat_fca/api/contact.py — submit_form (writes a "Microsites Form
# Submissions" record) and get_webinar_sessions (reads "Webinar Session").
#
# This is the same ERPNext site and the same two methods the Manufacturing
# microsite uses. Submissions from here are told apart by `source_url`, which
# carries the full pharma URL onto the record.
ERP_URL=https://satat.nbg.frappe.cloud
